Package: CUBClustR
Title: Clustering rating data within the CUB framework
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matteo", "Ventura", , "matteo.ventura@unibs.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for fitting and validating the Multivariate Latent Class CUB (MLC-CUB) model. 
    This package allows researchers to perform model-based clustering of multivariate rating data by disentangling 
    respondents' underlying attitudes (Feeling) and indecision (Uncertainty). It includes functions for model 
    estimation via the Expectation-Maximization (EM) algorithm, model selection, and visualization of clusters.
